{{Term/Store|Ruby Circlet|Ruby Circlets|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Ruby Circlets are a type of [[Circlet]] [[Accessory]] that is worn on [[Link]]'s head.<ref name="CaC 196"/> They can be purchased at the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] at [[Gerudo Town]] for 500 [[Rupee]]s and three [[Ruby|Rubies]].<ref name="BotW Isha"/> Alternatively, at the end of the "[[Tools of the Trade]]" [[Side Quest]], a Ruby Circlet is one of the Accessories that [[Isha]] offers to make for Link as a reward.<ref name="BotW Isha 2"/><ref name="BotW Isha 3"/> When worn, Ruby Circlets provide one level of [[Cold Resistance]] to Link.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They also provide the hidden [[Added Effect]] [[Ancient Pow Up]], increasing damage done by [[Ancient Soldier Gear]] and [[Guardian Gear]] by 20%.

Ruby Circlets can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

